1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:01,400
Fall into a volcano,

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:02,621
and you wouldn't sink.

3
00:00:03,281 --> 00:00:05,181
Lava is three times denser than

4
00:00:05,201 --> 00:00:05,721
your body,

5
00:00:06,001 --> 00:00:07,582
and a hundred times thicker than

6
00:00:07,642 --> 00:00:07,902
honey.

7
00:00:08,502 --> 00:00:09,202
So you'd hit it...

8
00:00:09,982 --> 00:00:11,083
and just lie on top.

9
00:00:11,703 --> 00:00:13,083
But you'd be in trouble long

10
00:00:13,123 --> 00:00:13,943
before you landed.

11
00:00:14,483 --> 00:00:15,924
The gas above the crater can

12
00:00:16,004 --> 00:00:17,064
knock you out in a few

13
00:00:17,164 --> 00:00:17,564
breaths.

14
00:00:18,264 --> 00:00:19,645
The lava glows at over a

15
00:00:19,805 --> 00:00:20,765
thousand degrees.

16
00:00:21,325 --> 00:00:22,745
Its heat hits you like two

17
00:00:22,845 --> 00:00:23,826
hundred suns.

18
00:00:24,506 --> 00:00:26,046
Your clothes catch fire before you

19
00:00:26,086 --> 00:00:26,706
even touch it.

20
00:00:27,226 --> 00:00:28,427
So if you ever stand at

21
00:00:28,467 --> 00:00:29,187
the edge of one...

22
00:00:29,847 --> 00:00:30,547
don't lean over.

